<figure id="fig-11-tenancy-grants"><img alt="图11 所有权、处理主体与受众扩权" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,"><figcaption>图11 所有权、处理主体与受众扩权 · 点击放大</figcaption><div class="figure-links"><a href="assets/v2/11-tenancy-grants.svg" target="_blank">独立打开原尺寸SVG</a></div></figure>

<details><summary>查看可编辑图源（与正文同源）</summary><pre>digraph G {
  rankdir=LR; graph [bgcolor=&quot;white&quot;, fontname=&quot;sans-serif&quot;, pad=&quot;0.25&quot;, nodesep=&quot;0.35&quot;, ranksep=&quot;0.6&quot;];
  node [shape=box, style=&quot;rounded,filled&quot;, fillcolor=&quot;#eef4fa&quot;, color=&quot;#687e96&quot;, fontname=&quot;sans-serif&quot;, fontsize=12];
