<figure id="fig-02-authority"><img alt="图02 三业务权威与不可变发布" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,"><figcaption>图02 三业务权威与不可变发布 · 点击放大</figcaption><div class="figure-links"><a href="assets/v2/02-authority.svg" target="_blank">独立打开原尺寸SVG</a></div></figure>

<details><summary>查看可编辑图源（与正文同源）</summary><pre>digraph G {
  rankdir=LR; graph [bgcolor=&quot;white&quot;, fontname=&quot;sans-serif&quot;, pad=&quot;0.25&quot;, nodesep=&quot;0.35&quot;, ranksep=&quot;0.6&quot;];
