</section><section><p><a id="sec-15"></a></p>
<h2 id="heading-15">15. 主要架构选择与双向追踪</h2>
<p>状态列为审查裁决，证据标签另列；CONFIRMED_FOR_SCOPE仅指该设计理由在核验范围成立，不是运行通过。完整每目标→代码/责任→章节/关闭题在 <a href="https://github.com/RSIXDB/ContextArk/blob/64adc1f215218bb8b39a29fe7af4500b9c6c4d35/docs/architecture/hindsight/TRACEABILITY-V2.csv">TRACEABILITY-V2.csv</a>，每目标出处在 <a href="https://github.com/RSIXDB/ContextArk/blob/64adc1f215218bb8b39a29fe7af4500b9c6c4d35/docs/architecture/hindsight/GOAL-SOURCES.csv">GOAL-SOURCES.csv</a>。</p>
<div class="table-wrap"><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>选择ID</th>
<th>本文方案与目标依据</th>
<th>替代/代价及裁决</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>C-01</td>
<td>G/Handler/W三功能集群独立且无状态；G鉴权/限流/监控/路由、内核在Handler/W本地复用；D-001/029/036/039/043</td>
<td>USER_AGREED（H11/H16），撤回上版合并建议；CONFIRMED_FOR_SCOPE为硬约束，实现NOT_RUN；HSRC-33—44</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-02</td>
<td>独立控制面/控制数据权威，数据面guard本地生效；D-012/023/030/040</td>
<td>独立MetaPG为方案B推荐，数据面仍保R；A/C及物理级别KD-10待审；CONFIRMED_FOR_SCOPE为职责边界；HSRC-03/10/26/28</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-03</td>
<td>产品元数据与三资产、原生事实/页分权；D-001/004/005/028</td>
<td>全塞memory_units失去轨迹/验证语义；全自建事实库重复责任，REVISE；INFERENCE+HSRC-20</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-04</td>
<td>原文/角色/条件保真、按需派生；D-002/003/008/037</td>
<td>全量抽象可能丢条件；原文路径增加token，CONFIRMED_FOR_SCOPE目标；HSRC-29+历史反例</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-05</td>
<td>多轴就绪/撤回/采用读模型；D-007/021/038</td>
<td>单completed不表达派生/入窗，REVISE；HSRC-27</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-06</td>
<td>原生受理事务+请求hash/来源委托；D-018/020</td>
<td>原件先OBS、PG再绑定；不以外部双写称原子；原生UUID不校hash，REVISE；HSRC-12/13</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-07</td>
<td>deny-first、不可变构件复用/Build membership、Publication与支持/页CAS；D-006/020/037</td>
<td>细粒度支持不足时整页/Bank隔离+回源，增加误封成本，REVISE；HSRC-22—24</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-08</td>
<td>Handler跨组协调、全局预算、批量hydrate与任务选择召回/精读/可选Reflect；D-009/010/024/034</td>
<td>不做默认全通道/第二层Agent循环；效果UNKNOWN；HSRC-19/29/30</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-09</td>
<td>Bundle与所有模型消费/Host UseReceipt受控dispatcher；D-011/015/029/031/033</td>
<td>无可控宿主仅服务返回合同；强G采用UNSUPPORTED该形态，REVISE；HSRC-09/32</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-10</td>
<td>Bank统一ACL及来源受众准入/扩权不变量、授权联检、延迟委托；D-012/013/014/015</td>
<td>混源ACL须全路径过滤且另验，CONFIRMED_FOR_SCOPE为R1候选；HSRC-06/08</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-11</td>
<td>按shard/profile分池，共享/专用隔离档单独重点审查；D-016/017/039</td>
<td>撤回tenant专用进程作默认的未审变更；威胁模型/档位仍PROPOSED；REVISE；HSRC-02/05/42</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-12</td>
<td>原生operation+attempt/guard全提交协议；D-018/019/021</td>
<td>单terminal状态fence不够；外部费用exactly-once REJECT；HSRC-14—17</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-13</td>
<td>Unit/Bank FOR SHARE屏障+Source/Page/Attempt对象CAS；D-020/022/037</td>
<td>冻结/撤权取排他屏障；无普通Bank/Unit热计数；真实PG锁探针NOT_RUN，REVISE；HSRC-17/21/23</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-14</td>
<td>Session→SkillVersion→Trial→Release→host；D-004/005/031</td>
<td>人工候选/R1，不称H原生自动Skill；REVISE v1另计遗漏；历史P02/P05/P06</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-15</td>
<td>三集群起步，保留租户/计算域/数据放置解耦、双placement及固定profile池；D-017/023/024/039</td>
<td>手工绑定与自动调度分期，不删除映射语义；CONFIRMED_FOR_SCOPE继承，容量UNKNOWN；HSRC-02/03/11/28/40/42/43</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-16</td>
<td>跨副本预算守恒/背压/实际尝试计量；D-022/030/033/035</td>
<td>原生轮转/保留槽不等于全局公平，REVISE；HSRC-14/28</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-17</td>
<td>原生图保留、外部投影按业务门触发；D-009/024/032</td>
<td>GraphRetriever≠权威Store替换；效果/许可未验，UNKNOWN；HSRC-18/19</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-18</td>
<td>冻结一致清单+单写epoch迁移；D-023/025/026</td>
<td>ZIP/updated_at不能保在途/硬删除，在线CDC后置，REVISE；HSRC-25/26</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-19</td>
<td>完整恢复/退出/版本束与quarantine；D-026/027/028/032</td>
<td>仅正文导出不保试用/权限语义，REVISE；历史P05+HSRC-25</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-20</td>
<td>工作包/Agent session与全生命周期成本，数值待校准；D-033/034/035/036</td>
<td>不复用v1工期或历史榜单作新产品保证，REJECT其当前承诺身份；INFERENCE</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-21</td>
<td>关键架构变化独立KD审查，未获接受保留既有边界展示备选；D-036/040</td>
<td>USER_AGREED（H11），不能以内部PASS/成本假设代替用户接受；CONFIRMED_FOR_SCOPE为审查规则，产品源码NOT_APPLICABLE</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-22</td>
<td>Tenant/Subtenant/Bank，组织归属/Manager/Grant/计费主体分开；D-041/047</td>
<td>对象定义USER_AGREED；推荐Tenant-owned Bank/Unit，多Subtenant共享；归Subtenant备选未选，REVISE；HSRC-45/46/48/56</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-23</td>
<td>C/R/U字段分类，MetaPG+DataPG rt/ud同库成对schema；D-042/048</td>
<td>分离目标USER_AGREED；方案B推荐非全元数据物理外置；A/C显式代价，REVISE；HSRC-45/47/49/50/51/52/55/79—81</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-24</td>
<td>G/Handler/W无状态，L/C副本与PG读/写扩展分责；D-043/044</td>
<td>用户目标USER_AGREED；跨worker_id接管/缩容与预算守恒待实现，REVISE；HSRC-14—17/40—43/51</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-25</td>
<td>LLM Adapter三类端口、逐次ProviderAttempt、三账本与UNKNOWN敞口；D-045/046/048</td>
<td>组件目标USER_AGREED；独立无状态服务及账务细节PROPOSED，REVISE；HSRC-61—72</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>C-26</td>
<td>既有OBS唯一原件先持久/校验再PG受理，同原件重建及显式清理；D-049/050</td>
<td>H14/H15 USER_AGREED顺序且不增副本/日志；具体故障/GC协议PROPOSED，REVISE；HSRC-73—78</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
<p>这套设计选择的共同边界是：有明确源码可复用处就保留；需触及核心的地方明确列补丁；不能满足或尚无输入的目标列降级与关闭题。完整性指D0设计交付，后续用户接受、产品实现、业务实跑和生产验证各自独立。</p>
</section><section><p><a id="sec-16"></a></p>
<h2 id="heading-16-llm-adapter">16. LLM Adapter：资格、发送、结果与账务</h2>
<figure id="fig-13-llm-adapter"><img alt="图13 独立L的资格与结果主路径" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,"><figcaption>图13 独立L的资格与结果主路径 · 点击放大</figcaption><div class="figure-links"><a href="assets/v2/13-llm-adapter.svg" target="_blank">独立打开原尺寸SVG</a></div></figure>

<details><summary>查看可编辑图源（与正文同源）</summary><pre>digraph G {
  rankdir=TB; graph [bgcolor=&quot;white&quot;, fontname=&quot;sans-serif&quot;, pad=&quot;0.25&quot;, nodesep=&quot;0.35&quot;, ranksep=&quot;0.6&quot;];
  node [shape=box, style=&quot;rounded,filled&quot;, fillcolor=&quot;#eef4fa&quot;, color=&quot;#687e96&quot;, fontname=&quot;sans-serif&quot;, fontsize=12];
  edge [color=&quot;#536b83&quot;, fontname=&quot;sans-serif&quot;, fontsize=10];
  hw [label=&quot;Handler / Worker\n无provider密钥/任意出网&quot;];
  l [label=&quot;L端口/编译\ngenerate/embed/rerank&quot;];
  m [label=&quot;Tenant-home MetaPG\nreserve→DISPATCHING CAS&quot;];
  p1 [label=&quot;Unit A rt资格过程\nAcquire/Consume/Drain&quot;];
  p2 [label=&quot;Unit B rt资格过程\n完整集合hash一致&quot;];
  send [label=&quot;单owner/nonce sender\n未知不接管重发&quot;];
  prov [label=&quot;provider / 受控本地池&quot;];
  obs [label=&quot;OBS派生Envelope\n受限key/hash/保留&quot;];
  result [label=&quot;MetaPG result-ready/usage\nW再经业务Attempt门&quot;];
  hw -&gt; l;
  l -&gt; m;
  l -&gt; p1;
  l -&gt; p2;
  p1 -&gt; send [label=&quot;全部消费收据&quot;];
  p2 -&gt; send;
  m -&gt; send [label=&quot;明确CAS成功&quot;];
  send -&gt; prov;
  prov -&gt; obs;
  obs -&gt; result;
  result -&gt; hw [label=&quot;Result.Get&quot;];
}</pre></details>

<figure id="fig-14-model-billing-state"><img alt="图14 模型未知、结果持久与独立账务" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,"><figcaption>图14 模型未知、结果持久与独立账务 · 点击放大</figcaption><div class="figure-links"><a href="assets/v2/14-model-billing-state.svg" target="_blank">独立打开原尺寸SVG</a></div></figure>

<details><summary>查看可编辑图源（与正文同源）</summary><pre>digraph G {
  rankdir=TB; graph [bgcolor=&quot;white&quot;, fontname=&quot;sans-serif&quot;, pad=&quot;0.25&quot;, nodesep=&quot;0.35&quot;, ranksep=&quot;0.6&quot;];
  node [shape=box, style=&quot;rounded,filled&quot;, fillcolor=&quot;#eef4fa&quot;, color=&quot;#687e96&quot;, fontname=&quot;sans-serif&quot;, fontsize=12];
  edge [color=&quot;#536b83&quot;, fontname=&quot;sans-serif&quot;, fontsize=10];
  call [label=&quot;ModelCall逻辑键&quot;];
  res [label=&quot;reservation + ProviderAttempt&quot;];
  parts [label=&quot;全部Unit parts CONSUMED&quot;];
  cas [label=&quot;MetaPG CAS成功\n唯一incarnation/nonce&quot;];
  wire [label=&quot;实际send\n崩溃可能已发&quot;];
  out [label=&quot;ResponseEnvelope持久\nresult-ready&quot;];
  usage [label=&quot;UsageObservation nullable\n事件去重/真实付款路径&quot;];
  cost [label=&quot;ProviderCostLedger\n成本/UNKNOWN敞口&quot;];
  bill [label=&quot;CustomerBillingLedger\n收费政策待接受&quot;];
